1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,771
There's a hole in what you see.

2
00:00:02,271 --> 00:00:06,399
Where the optic nerve leaves your eye, there are no light sensors at all.

3
00:00:06,899 --> 00:00:09,865
Your brain fills that spot with whatever surrounds it.

4
00:00:10,365 --> 00:00:13,052
Try it: close your left eye and stare at the cross.

5
00:00:13,352 --> 00:00:15,441
Move your phone slowly closer.

6
00:00:15,441 --> 00:00:16,624
The dot vanishes.

7
00:00:17,124 --> 00:00:18,430
You never see the hole.
